{"id":30706931447,"name":"Run api tests","node_id":"WFR_kwLOA_1uaM8AAAAHJkaW9w","head_branch":"fix/visualization-datadimensionitems-sortorder-gap","head_sha":"70c0cb7b73e40e94333b692b73b8ff476bd10614","path":".github/workflows/run-api-tests.yml","run_number":51609,"run_attempt":1,"event":"pull_request","display_title":"test: data integrity check for visualization data dimension item sort order gaps","status":"completed","conclusion":"success","workflow_id":5591308,"check_suite_id":83273997148,"check_suite_node_id":"CS_kwDOA_1uaM8AAAATY4RbXA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447","pull_requests":[{"id":4184474241,"number":24685,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/pulls/24685","head":{"ref":"fix/visualization-datadimensionitems-sortorder-gap","sha":"d174353e2779a60af9bb74f181d482379659ba4c","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}},"base":{"ref":"master","sha":"b0e6edce8edf5c27ff78e3e4ea5a828b77442d61","repo":{"id":66940520,"name":"dhis2-core","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core"}}}],"created_at":"2026-08-01T15:53:55Z","updated_at":"2026-08-01T16:05:49Z","run_started_at":"2026-08-01T15:53:55Z","jobs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447/jobs","logs_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447/logs","check_suite_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/check-suites/83273997148","artifacts_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447/artifacts","cancel_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447/cancel","rerun_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/runs/30706931447/rerun","head_commit":{"message":"test: add data integrity check for visualization data dimension item sort order gaps\n\nA gap in visualization_datadimensionitems.sort_order (e.g. 0, 1, 3 instead of\n0, 1, 2) causes Hibernate's indexed \u003clist\u003e mapping for\nVisualization.dataDimensionItems to silently reconstruct a null element at\nthe missing index. VisualizationController then throws an unhandled NPE\nwhen processing that null element for any request returning the affected\nvisualization, whether via list, search, or direct fetch.\n\nAdd a new data integrity check (analytical_objects/visualizations_wrong_sort_order.yaml),\nmodeled on the existing option_sets_wrong_sort_order.yaml pattern, to detect\nthis condition. Severity CRITICAL rather than INFO, since this causes a hard\napplication error rather than a cosmetic issue.\n\nFound via a production incident where this NPE recurred continuously for\nusers opening files in the Data Visualizer app; root cause confirmed via a\nfull stack trace and directly verified in the database.\n\nA defensive code fix and the deeper architectural fix (converting the\nunderlying Hibernate mapping to a Set with order-by, matching the existing\nProgramStage.programStageDataElements pattern) are tracked as follow-up work.","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"70c0cb7b73e40e94333b692b73b8ff476bd10614","tree_id":"a9e9ec46d850271d08a957ab825febfa390d3b87","timestamp":"2026-08-01T15:53:28Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/5591308","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}",